{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y把部分关键因果和前后铺垫压得太短，尤其S05、S07、S08，观众不如看X时容易明白他为什么会发生这次转变。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的短话配合放大加亮的关键词，让我边听边扫时更容易抓住每段的心理变化；按音乐时机出现的感受也更具体，有身体感觉、环境画面和情绪的细微起伏，不只是笼统地甜、怕或难过。X在解释人物为什么收住、为什么又敢靠近，以及前一次经历怎样影响下一次时更完整，整条心理变化的因果链更牢靠。但实际观看时，X的长句需要持续阅读，容易错过音乐和右侧感受，因此整体选Y。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9cb9a8a8-61d3-48cb-859a-3284149f9edc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060126387668Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:02:05.547665+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "577ee70d3d78617a124776fae25ec56e3c69bc6379a5c05e7ed01b28ae095c67", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7